STATEMENT: >>>
Generated numerical campaigns shall compare bounded circuit results with independent analytical equations and retain minimized failing inputs and provider identity. Numerical hardening shall not silently relax independent backward-error or physical tolerances to hide generated failures. Any refinement shall be bounded and preserve explicit failure when verification does not pass.
