[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REM-003
TITLE: Bounded provenance-checked evidence export
STATEMENT: >>>
Remote publication shall verify finished endurance metadata against the checkout revision and declared source hashes, reject malformed or unsafe paths and dirty/stale source, and stage only a manifest and checksum file. The manifest shall be capped at 256 KiB and contain structured outcomes, source identity, tools, seeds, durations, coverage availability and log hashes. Raw logs, credentials, binaries, absolute work paths and large corpora shall remain local.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: scripts/RemoteQualification.cs. Verification: tests/Remote.Tests.ps1 synthetic local-Git fixtures; real-workflow and coverage scope recorded in evidence/remote-workflow-qualification.md. Evidence is reviewable run output, not a cryptographic attestation of test execution.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REM-002

