UID: END-004
TITLE: Recoverable checkpoint sharing contention
STATEMENT: >>>
Checkpoint replacement shall retry transient file access failures for at most two seconds, retain valid JSON and record retries. Permanent failures shall remain failures rather than silently losing evidence.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: scripts/Endurance.cs. Verification: scripts/Test-CheckpointContention.ps1 and evidence/checkpoint-contention.json deliberately deny delete sharing for 500 milliseconds during a live campaign.
