[REQUIREMENT]
UID: MUT-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Pristine mutation baselines and checked name selection
STATEMENT: >>>
Reused mutation build caches shall refresh owned package artifacts before baseline verification so that a previous mutant binary cannot be mistaken for unmutated source. Vendor dependency caches may remain. Cache cleanup shall stay within its checked target directory and refuse linked cache paths. A requested mutation-name filter shall be checked against the native candidate inventory before mutation; unsupported or escaped selection shall fail without executing mutants.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
