[REQUIREMENT]
UID: NUM-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Bounded nonworsening QR refinement
STATEMENT: >>>
The reference QR adapter shall retain a nonworsening independent componentwise backward error during at most three same-precision refinement corrections, reject nonfinite corrections, and leave final numerical acceptance to the analysis. Equal-error corrections may continue within the fixed budget. Unique algebraic solutions shall not be treated as guarantees of representable numerical accuracy.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: src/backend.rs. Verification: tests/property_campaign.rs::qr_refinement_never_worsens_componentwise_error, mixed row scales and independently computed error; final-435-qr-counterexample.json retains a rejected test hypothesis about raw QR accuracy. Existing analytical circuit regressions remain independent acceptance evidence.
<<<
