[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REM-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Git-stable evidence bytes
STATEMENT: >>>
New remote manifests and checksum documents shall serialize as UTF-8 with LF structural newlines so their byte checksums survive the repository's Git text policy. Verification shall read actual stored Git blobs, not reconstructed checkout text. Historical mismatched evidence shall remain unchanged and explicitly flagged.
