Implementation: scripts/RemoteQualification.cs uses BCL JsonSerializerOptions.NewLine. Verification: tests/Remote.Tests.ps1 actual bare-remote blob checksum regression, observed failing before the fix on Windows. The five old Windows artifacts remain immutable; CRLF reconstruction diagnoses their mismatch without repairing or validating the stored checksums.
