Each retained overnight survivor shall have a stable triage ID, original tested source and native report hash, mutation identity, affected requirement, classification, and actual replay evidence or an explicit unverified state. Tests shall challenge independent behavior without weakening acceptance tolerances to improve mutation counts. Exact-name replay shall verify the native inventory before execution; equivalent or masked behavior shall not be counted as caught without evidence.
<<<
