STATEMENT: >>>
Qualification shall exercise inclusive exact resource and assertion limits, independently malformed policy fields, signed two-live-terminal diode currents, Gmin audit scaling, inductor voltage-bound scaling and worst-observation retention. The artifact reader shall reject a trailing byte beyond its real maximum even when the bounded prefix is a valid checksummed result. Tests shall use independently stated physical equations or policy limits rather than weakening tolerances or suppressing surviving mutations.
<<<
